- Added reviewID to recordReviewerRequest and runReviewerAgent functions to link requests and decisions.
- Implemented SessionRetry for transient provider failures in reviewer sessions.
- Updated metadata handling in session prompts to preserve auto-review information across updates.
- Enhanced tests to verify auto-review functionality and ensure metadata integrity during session processing.
- Improved UI feedback for auto-review status in various tool interactions.

